-4208-a18f-8382ad9a680c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"もし自分がやるならビジュアルモードに\u0026lt;C-]\u0026gt;を仕込むかな、解除してジャンプするやつ","ts":"1625195738.235200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"29Nd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8492af1e-4e16-4aaa-9ee2-6f397fca1d37","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁその後C-]押すのはほぼないのでどうにか","ts":"1625195706.235100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4ddcf2d-4de1-42c9-8c9b-c07850814515","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ありますねー","ts":"1625195692.234700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"slW4X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dfc7d94-245d-40ec-8945-cc9bf89d480b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`s` と `t` 潰すのはよく見るけど `r` と `v` はめずらしい。\n`v` は副作用ありそうですね","ts":"1625195678.234500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qavUl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4004cae-38d0-42fa-be44-9fe3b858c9d6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"cocに限らずこれでいけるはず","ts":"1625195624.233900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D0vq+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8335f75b-88b7-408d-ad95-8c8457ecb927","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ってやってます","ts":"1625195586.233600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Jb4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cf87ef4-3a90-4385-83e9-0f7b4679aa03","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"遅れた、自分は\n```nnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; s\u0026lt;C-]\u0026gt; :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;wincmd ]\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\nnnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; v\u0026lt;C-]\u0026gt; :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;vertical wincmd ]\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\nnnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; t\u0026lt;C-]\u0026gt; :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;tab wincmd ]\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\nnnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; r\u0026lt;C-]\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;}```","ts":"1625195583.233400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qIMI1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"531e410b-fa04-44e5-9820-33c8337f89ef","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"今回は範囲指定の部分にあたるのがsplitの指定みたいな","ts":"1625195569.233000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nUB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8424cdd-ec8b-4152-80af-06503a062d68","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"定義ジャンプのように別のバッファにうつること自体は Vim ではよくやりますよね。 `gf` とか。あちらは `\u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;f` というマッピングもありますが。\nそれに慣れたら単純な定義ジャンプはウィンドウやタブを増やさないでやる挙動が自然に感じられるかもしれないですね。","ts":"1625195478.232000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625195492.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q/ZN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec67f533-ae4b-4273-bcb9-d5e3bd18ec47","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Vimっぽいのは動作キーバインドと範囲指定キーバインドを組み合わせてなんでもできる、というやつかな\ntext-objectみたいな","ts":"1625195476.231900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Yb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd020ea4-4ebe-4c48-bc72-e0d6029fbafb","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"ひとまずやりたかったことはできたので解決です。ありがとうございました!","ts":"1625188268.228700","edited":{"user":"UD1FQV38V","ts":"1625188271.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":4,"users":["U7TMPGWJ0","U782D5DF1","U8CC7MDCL","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MDrM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"597995ac-4bca-4211-96c6-1870c1635563","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"map増やさないのは指針の一つとして良さそうですね、テキストエディタ独特だな…","ts":"1625187626.228100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ABtV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1AC34957-39EC-42B1-97FF-164C7372F002","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"マッピングどんどん増やしても忘れちゃうし。","ts":"1625187077.226700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TFdX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95541888-B537-4821-B79C-7E5593124297","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"とりあえず今回の定義ジャンプで自動分割やタブで開かれるって設定にすることについては、それをすると、僕個人では逆にできなくなることが増える（カレントで開きたい）のと、それを解消するために追加でマッピングを増やしたりしなきゃいけなくなるのがイヤかなってくらいですね。","ts":"1625187034.225700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jUYl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21FB369A-96DF-4854-8BE6-9F975C373509","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Vimっぽさ、たしかに難しい...なんでしょうね...","ts":"1625186838.220700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xxf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d85a112e-6305-4b44-b18a-1fcbf227fe23","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ぽいかはわからないけど、Vimとしてtagジャンプのスタックは同じウィンドウでやっていく(そして戻る)みたいな動きになるから、そこを生かすとsplit -\u0026gt; jumpなんだろなとは思った(いま聞いて)","ts":"1625186691.219700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aDv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28184671-0d46-44a0-9b15-74afb43a202f","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"Vimっぽい、どのへんで感覚掴むんでしょうか…\nPythonは書いてたりdoc読んでるうちにわかってきた気がしてるのですが、Vimは手がかりがないので","ts":"1625186428.218500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"52r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FABE7D98-9B0C-4E35-ADD1-DE4DD73AA65C","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"とかで場所いくらでも指定できて便利","ts":"1625186217.216200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hGz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C246EDE3-E1FF-443B-