","author_subname":"yaegassy","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U7TMPGWJ0","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a36a7ed02d64ce6f40a20ebfe0a9f59d.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0025-48.png","text":"僕はタブじゃなくて大体 \u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;s (:split相当) とか \u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;v (:vsplit) してからそれで定義ジャンプすることが多いのですが。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1625185216.198500,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1625185216198500","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1625185216198500"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WIJwy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3b806f5-1657-4f24-8dda-99673af82c7e","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"coc-settings.json追記したらできた。ありがとうございます","ts":"1625185754.205700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EhJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5E346580-DAEA-4155-A768-A544B7D43663","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Vimっぽいのは分けてから飛ぶ","ts":"1625185723.205100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j=S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dc95222-8996-43cc-8413-f2ae48208d44","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とはいえcocの流儀で設定する方がよさそうな気がします","ts":"1625185657.204600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4WAl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"609c6c7f-e928-4a00-9456-081ad764648e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tabnewは空のバッファ作っちゃうので","ts":"1625185619.204400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+i3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dadc2ebe-46c8-4128-b25c-f0cf995aea90","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"peacockさんが書いてるやつtabnewをtab splitにしたら動きそうな気がする","ts":"1625185608.204300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AvHY0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41f20cd5-caa1-43e6-87ea-72d53ea817f6","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"まー、やり方はたくさんありそう。","ts":"1625185583.203700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4u/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5235293-2452-482c-a841-1b40a8531242","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"デフォがeditですが、これを `tabe` にするとタブで開くように変更もできるようです。","ts":"1625185535.203400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OTSa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"181aa70c-195b-41fc-ba7d-d9fe3d162cda","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/neoclide/coc.nvim/blob/release/data/schema.json#L1070-L1088\u003e","ts":"1625185481.202400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/neoclide/coc.nvim/blob/release/data/schema.json | schema.json\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/neoclide/coc.nvim/blob/release/data/schema.json | schema.json\u003e","text":"```\n    \"coc.preferences.jumpCommand\": {\n      \"anyOf\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"edit\",\n            \"split\",\n            \"vsplit\",\n            \"tabe\",\n            \"drop\",\n            \"tab drop\",\n            \"pedit\"\n          ]\n        },\n        { \"type\": \"string\", \"minimum\": 1 }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Command used for location jump, like goto definition, goto references etc. Can be also a custom command that gives file as an argument.\",\n      \"default\": \"edit\"\n    },\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/neoclide/coc.nvim|neoclide/coc.nvim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zwn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5d0ab3b-602c-4f22-bdf1-66bea7df6059","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"やりたいことは↑でできそう","ts":"1625185473.202200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NEg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04b7425d-f534-42ff-b878-f9d35389db4b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これは普通に動きましたね\n```:call CocAction('jumpDefinition', 'split')```","ts":"1625185469.202000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i+u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74d4feae-9394-468a-b91e-768428628e82","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですね","ts":"1625185458.201600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hjjEa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e199552c-eaeb-4bc8-be40-98bebe053b96","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`coc.preferences.jumpCommand` って設定を coc-settings.json に書くことができるようです。","ts":"1625185425.201200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mhAV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8918b19b-d870-4336-9f21-4de5ac970c1c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"yaegassyさんのやつでもいけそう","ts":"1625185395.200600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JX6W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b8e8507-b394-4cee-9744-4874dca3bd5a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"`coc.preferences.jumpCommand`で変えられるっぽいです","ts":"1625185372.200300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LWw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d80d548-f180-40e1-a93f-a32e8473372e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"openCommand がありますね","ts":"1625185362.200100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S/Qh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb27e48e-5819-4682-8d6f-eb63088c367b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```\"jumpDefinition\" [{openCommand}]\t\t\t*coc-action-jumpDefinition*\n\n\tjump to definition position of the current symbol.\n\tReturn `v:false` when location not found.\n\n\t|coc-list-location| is used when more than one position is available.\n\n\tTo always use |coc-list-location|| for locations, use `v:false` for\n\t{openCommand}.\n\n\t{openCommand}: optional command to open buffer, default to\n\t`coc.preferences.jumpCommand` in `coc-settings.json````","ts":"1625185357.199900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GnM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58d9e950-0703-4232-b257-d1cc05c0c06f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なんかスマートなのがあった気がするんですがとりあえずこんな感じでやりたいことはできると思います。\n\n```:call CocAction('jumpDefinition', 'split')\n:call CocAction('jumpDefinition', 'vsplit')\n:call CocAction('jumpDefinition', 'tabe')```","ts":"1625185314.199600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UDDCM376D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dg73L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3496322-8926-4129-9525-dd2bfc180f6b","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":":spしてそいつにジャンプ結果飛ばす感じです?","ts":"1625185269.199200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FMNLd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f5bf4f2-00e7-4d9c-9f47-a01c58e1a36d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕はタブじゃなくて大体 \u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;s (:split相当) とか \u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;v (:vsplit) してからそれで定義ジャンプすることが多いのですが。","ts":"1625185216.198500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["UBNPMJJGM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A+zFC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a88fdb8a-2cbd-4bc2-905d-2d5b32f1fd84","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"コックはなんかあった気がします。なんだったろう","ts":"1625185184.198300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jGX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fd67303-8667-4f8a-8ab0-33142659f278","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"```nmap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; gd :tabnew\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(coc-definition)```\nとかで行けないかな、と思ったけどそんなに甘くなかった…","ts":"1625185126.197900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ygE8z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"507e1b5e-3989-46b7-ae5c-39222ccef4cd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(設定面倒なので高速にtab splitするやつ仕込んでそれ打ってから飛んでるやつ)","ts":"1625185103.197400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1V/S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40a89d4e-d5a9-49f4-a81b-335d96f4db2a","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"なるほど","ts":"1625185056.196800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RK8cz"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n:[count]tabe[dit]                               *:tabe* *:tabedit* *:tabnew*\n:[count]tabnew\n                カレントタブページの後ろに空のウィンドウを持った新しいタブペー\n                ジを作成します。[count] が与えられた場合、新しいタブページは\n                [count] 番目のタブページの後ろに作成され、[count] が省略された\n                場合はカレントタブページの後ろに作成されます。   \n                        :tabnew         \" カレントタブページの後ろに新規タブ\n                                        \" ページを作成\n                        :.tabnew        \" 同上\n                        :+tabnew        \" 右のタブページの後ろに新規タブページ\n                                        \" を作成\n                                        \" 注: tabnew よりも1つ右側に作られる\n                        :-tabnew        \" カレントタブページの前に新規タブ\n                                        \" ページを作成\n                        :0tabnew        \" 新規タブページを左端に作成\n                        :$tabnew        \" 新規タブページを右端に作成\n \n:[count]tabe[dit] [++opt] [+cmd] {file}\n:[count]tabnew [++opt] [+cmd] {file}\n                {file} を新しいタブページで開きます。|:edit| と同じです。\n                [count] については上記 |:tabnew| 参照。\n```","ts":"1625185048.196600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"6c0ee19d-bb99-4c3b-a7b4-6a366d7ffdb6","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":":h tabe","ts":"1625185048.196500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7MS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90b779de-aed9-4be4-8231-887c37c9c0a9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"cocまだそこまで使いこなせてないから分からんな、誰か頼む","ts":"1625185045.196400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=ULVd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"694dc6c0-e9f2-4378-8ff3-aea4f2749f7e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とりあえず:eは:tabeで代替可能です","ts":"1625185022.196200","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1625185066.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u4uo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7afa674c-e813-4bbb-9fcd-254bb96c64b0","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"LSPはcocです","ts":"1625185017.196100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DP5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61854d3a-915f-4d5f-bbc3-7b7100828ddc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"LSPクライアント何使ってます？","ts":"1625185002.195700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/wG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2365027-f866-4ceb-b709-12178977d063","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"help引こうにもキーワードわからんので教えて下さい。\n\n別ファイルを開く( `:e` とかLSPの定義ジャンプ)際に別tabで開きたいんですが、なにかいい方法ありますか?\n定義ジャンプで別ファイル見に行ったときにcurrentで開きたくないのが一番の目的です","ts":"1625184907.195600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YCVY2"}]}]
